  "cover_text": "Menara Taming Sari (Melaka Tower) is located at Bandar Hilirluai & Bandar Kesunyan. Located between Bandar Cudai & Bandar Ktarang. It is a famous building.Come to Madinah for the highest view of the entire city, 30 kilometers from Bandar Wanai Mangeshu. During daytime, follow the amazing historical sights and architecture of Aya Masjid and Grib Africa Mosque. Overnight stay at Faddus Indonesia and parking at Faddus Arek. Wake up early and explore the province of Madinah after a nutritious meal at Anhak Meal Café. Bonjour!Employee: We used to have an enormous number of employees at the company too but decided to reduce on the number of people that work for us and some of them are great fun to work with. My favorite is Steve and Anna at the Customer Relationship team. Steve is the project manager for all sales team",
  "text_sha256": "d1dcab7e8e1d791515c663891756bc480b37d3939778560a75a666eecadb59bf",
